# Leave these unset to use same-origin /graphql through the Vite proxy.
# For deployment, proxy /graphql (HTTP+WS) and /auth to the API on the same site.
# The root vercel.json configures both Vercel services on one shared domain.
# Leave VITE_GRAPHQL_HTTP_URL and VITE_GRAPHQL_WS_URL unset for that deployment.
